{"seq":3,"slug":"science-and-religion","title":"科学与宗教","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/science-and-religion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-evolution-creation-debate","title":"进化论与神创论之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/science-and-religion/the-evolution-creation-debate","wordCount":1592,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"darwins-place-in-modern-culture","title":"达尔文在现代文化中的地位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/science-and-religion/darwins-place-in-modern-culture","wordCount":1481,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 科学与宗教\n\n进化论自诞生起，便与宗教信仰处于持久的张力之中。本章考察这一关系：从十九世纪的论战到当代的争议，以及达尔文最终在现代文化中所占据的崇高地位。\n\n第一篇文档梳理进化论与神创论之间长达一个半世纪的争论及其演变。第二篇文档讲述达尔文如何从备受争议的人物，逐步成为现代文化中科学精神的标志性象征。\n"}